cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "GDC Lens: censoring-aware, cross-cohort evaluation of breast cancer prognostic models"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/PRITIDIPADAS/gdclens"
url: "https://pritidipadas.github.io/gdclens/"
abstract: >-
  Leave-one-site-out evaluation of a breast cancer Cox model on TCGA-BRCA (NCI Genomic Data Commons)
  and five METABRIC cohorts, with censoring-aware measures, a label audit, local recalibration,
  an evidence check for each estimate, and a browser tool for checking a centre's own patients.
  Research use only.
keywords:
  - prognostic model
  - external validation
  - calibration
  - censoring
  - breast cancer
  - Genomic Data Commons
authors:
  - family-names: Das
    given-names: Pritidipa
